# Design Philosophy

BugLens follows an **AI Recommendation + Human Validation** approach. AI-generated severity, priority, root causes, regression scope, and other insights are treated as recommendations rather than definitive decisions.

AI capabilities are also optional, allowing QA Engineers to choose the depth of analysis required for each issue. This supports lightweight workflows for simple bugs while providing deeper analysis when needed.

# Future Roadmap

Future development may expand BugLens with **Screenshot Analysis, Console Log Analysis, Network Request Analysis, HAR File Support, Jira Integration, Accessibility Suggestions, and Performance Recommendations**.

# Author

Built by a QA Engineer as an end-to-end **AI + Quality Engineering project**, combining AI-assisted QA workflows with practical API testing, UI automation, regression testing, and continuous integration.